  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the proposed 1m crown reduction below previous points on T4 Ash, as the justification provided, that the tree is becoming too tall and the client prefers a smaller height, does not amount to a sound arboricultural reason for significant reduction on a TPOd tree. The works would exceed previous maintenance and would unnecessarily remove healthy regrowth, harming the tree's structure and amenity contribution. No evidence has been supplied to show that the tree presents a risk, is causing actionable nuisance or requires intervention to maintain good management. A heightdriven reduction of this nature is therefore not supported and would result in avoidable harm."
